{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_02",
  "title": "首轮竞赛",
  "storyCode": "DH-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e877ba430793531cb570be64d05c450f1560fc345adc945ddb7929490a458904",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好强，太强了！鼠胆龙威队，在被三支队伍联手围攻的局面之下，轻松将他们击退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，林女侠在战斗中使用的究竟是什么能力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "导播，切一下回放！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只见林雨霞的手在身边房屋的玻璃窗上轻轻一抹，玻璃如同熔化了一般缓慢消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而后，她的手中出现了一把锋利的刀刃，这把刀刃几近无色，只有反射阳光带来的细微光芒证明着它确实存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一回终于看清楚了，林女侠居然能够将玻璃转化为武器，这真是令人意想不到的能力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没想到林女侠不光武艺高超，还有这般精彩的源石技艺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，不过Missy，林小姐这是什么能力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和鼠王一样，其实她也是在操纵沙子，只是方向不太一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她从小能随随便便地把沙子变成玻璃什么的，我经常问她要来玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噢，懂了，确实，玻璃也是用沙子做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，我听说鼠王可以用沙子搞出沙尘暴，林小姐行不行啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道，不过我猜她就算会，也不会喜欢那么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是，林小姐看起来不像是喜欢大开大合的类型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林女侠那防不胜防的源石技艺，配合陈女侠精准的铳法，还有埃内斯托先生的补漏，一次完美的视觉盛宴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如何，潘乔先生，您认为这次的胜利会属于这支队伍吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这支队伍个人能力很强，不过配合还欠缺火候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来如此，确实，在这样的比赛中，如果过分强调个人能力，可是会被其他人盯上然后排除掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "历史一再地向我们证明，只有团结才能够取得最后的胜利！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个老头眼光很尖啊，一眼就看出来老陈和林小姐现在最大的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确实，这两个人，老陈么，跟你搭档惯了至少知道配合，不过她完全不知道林雨霞是怎么打的，自己又用的不是最拿手的剑，束手束脚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于林雨霞，这个女人就根本不知道配合这两个字是怎么写的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看好几次她差点把老陈也伤到了，全靠老陈反应够快闪了过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "笑死我了，不知道的还以为她们俩配合无间呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个叫埃内斯托的倒也聪明，根本没往两个人身边靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然啊，他有几条命都不够用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不错啊，Missy，观察力越来越好了，我还以为我要给你讲解一下呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为了接过陈晖洁的位置我也是很努力的好不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可从没怀疑过这一点，只是没想到Missy你的进步这么快，真不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别一副老前辈的样子在那感慨了，小心我扣你工资。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，那可千万别，您老大人有大量，别跟我一个小卒一般计较。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，这还像话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过你还真别说，看她们这配合，让我有点想起刚认识老陈的时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她那时就这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪里，反过来，那时的她，和现在的林小姐差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是让那时的她和现在的林小姐组队，那恐怕真的打着打着她们两个就打起来了，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的玻璃刀好几次差点割到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的水弹准头也不怎么样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来不只是情感上，战术上我们也不适合组队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很有说服力的结论，还是分头行动吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这样吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然我知道两位彼此不太对付，不过既然组成了队伍，那还是尽量像一支队伍一样行动吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前也说过，比赛途中无法通信，而且两位不仅要找赤金，还想要调查可能存在的危险分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然两位的个人能力很强，但炎国不是有句话叫做——不怕一万，只怕万一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我的提议是，无论有没有获得赤金，我们一小时在这里碰一次头，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有一方没来，另一方见机行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼，两位愿意配合那再好不过，那就这么办吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我先走一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林小姐走得真快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陈小姐，你是打算单独行动，还是让我和你一起行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用为我和她考虑太多，我和她都不是为了赌气能什么都不管不顾的人，对的不会说成错的，该做的还是会做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......平心而论，即使没有合不合适的问题，分头行动也是第一轮比赛中非常常见的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不过，我们只有三个人，我认为是没有三人都分散出去的必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我还是跟你一起行动吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以。走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
